Deterministic valuation operators
---------------------------------
The valuation approach in
``research/src/edge_relative_research/fundamentals/`` follows the
"numbers are code-computed, narratives are LLM-assisted" separation used by
FinRobot (https://github.com/AI4Finance-Foundation/FinRobot),
Copyright the AI4Finance Foundation, licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0 (http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0).

The operators here are independent implementations of standard, published
financial formulas (CAPM/WACC, discounted cash flow, Gordon growth,
comparable-company multiples). No source code was copied verbatim. Where a
specific adaptation is made from FinRobot, the affected file records it and
the modification is noted here. FinRobot's trademark is not used.

